<title>FRANCE: Axa's Bebear to head Axa/UAP management bd.</title>
<headline>Axa's Bebear to head Axa/UAP management bd.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Axa Chairman Claude Bebear will chair the management board of the newly-merged Axa/UAP company, UAP Chairman Jacques Friedmann said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Friedmann will chair the supervisory board of the new company, he said. He will also head a committee aimed at deciding strategy.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
